<div class="auth-layout"><section class="auth-story"><a class="brand" href="/login"><img src="/icon.svg" alt="" width="40" height="40">LeadCurrent</a><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLARITY. A LOT OF MOMENTUM.</span><h1>Your next win<br>starts with<br><em>the next move.</em></h1><p>Bring your leads, conversations, and opportunities together. Spend less time finding what to do, and more time making it happen.</p><div class="auth-metrics"><span>24h<strong>First-contact focus</strong></span><span>One view<strong>Your next best action</strong></span></div></div><small>Built for meaningful relationships.</small></section><section class="auth-card"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKSPACE AWAITS</span><h2>Good to see you.</h2><p class="muted">Sign in and move your day forward.</p><%= form_with url: login_path do |f| %><div class="field"><%= f.label :email, "Email address" %><%= f.email_field :email, required: true, autocomplete: "username", autofocus: true %></div><div class="field"><%= f.label :password %><%= f.password_field :password, required: true, autocomplete: "current-password" %></div><%= f.submit "Sign in →", class: "button full", data: { turbo_submits_with: "Signing in…" } %><% end %><p class="auth-footer">New here? <%= link_to "Create a workspace", signup_path %></p></section></div>